VERSION 2
RULE baseline.mobile.ios.framework.alamofire.servertrustevaluating_disabled_with_disabledtrustevaluator VERSION 1
IN FILE
WHEN TEXT_MATCHES "DisabledTrustEvaluator\\s*\\(\\s*\\)|DisabledEvaluation|trustAllCertificates|serverTrustManager\\s*=\\s*nil" "im"
REPORT "TLS Certificate Validation Review"
SEVERITY INFO
CONFIDENCE LOW
WITH TRACE
